From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:19:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve bounded relay actions through dispatcher
 backpressure

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Retain bounded transaction relay output actions while dispatcher backpressure prevents immediate delivery. Add a relay output regression so transient output refusal does not silently lose work or require unbounded queues.

